Subject: [PATCH 14/47] lakeside r4: day refit on the engine-camera r5h3
 reference (water, reflected sky, fog, lights)

Fitted on the Mac-calibrated HDR+ACES stand-in (exposure F16 / 1/125 s / ISO100 -> 2.604e-5)
against ENGINE_COLOR_REFERENCE/engine_cam_r5h3 (10 points within 9/channel, stripe std 2.3).
Values only, in GGbot's single source (LAKESIDE_DIR_LIGHT_PARAMS -> lakesideWaterMaterial /
applyLakesideWaterMode), so board and journey lake both get them.
Water: tint 0.714/0.858/1, main 2.51, amb 2.87, skyStrength 0.387, floor 0.323, horizon
0.204/0.297/0.003 (reflected shore), low 0.173/0.221/0.481, zenith 0.3/0.15/0.465.
Lights: sun 0.95, ambient 0.236, sky 0.0107/0.0656/0.082, ground 0.97/0.533/0.296. Fog 231/165/125,
layered top 4.16 / range 74 / atten 59.2. Night sun/ambient re-derived to keep moon/sun 0.857 and
ambient 0.219 (1.173 / 0.643). Effect defaults = day params.
